    {
      "id": "24",
      "type": "related_content",
      "attributes": {
        "id": 24,
        "relationship_type": "related",
        "body": "も and と are two different particles with different meanings. も means 'also' or 'too' and is used to add information, like in 田中さんも来ました ('Tanaka came, too'). と can be used to connect nouns like 'and' (バナナとりんご = 'a banana and an apple') or to mean 'with' (友だちと遊ぶ = 'to play with a friend').",
        "first_relatable": {
